                        The segmented control uses <SgTypography As="SgTypographyElement.Code" Size="SgTypographySize.Sm">role="tablist"</SgTypography> and <SgTypography As="SgTypographyElement.Code" Size="SgTypographySize.Sm">aria-selected</SgTypography> for proper screen reader support. Provide a descriptive <SgTypography As="SgTypographyElement.Code" Size="SgTypographySize.Sm">AriaLabel</SgTypography>.
                    </SgTypography>
                    <PropertyTable Items="_a11yProperties" />
